WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.810
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:13.820
Last time: train with examples, then test

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:19.440
Chapter 2 · Patterns Everywhere

4
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:26.740
Let's become pattern detectives!

5
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:33.600
Meet Meera, making a Diwali garland

6
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:41.900
Orange, yellow, orange, yellow…

7
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:51.480
"Meera, can you carry on?"

8
00:00:51.480 --> 00:01:01.870
Orange or yellow next? Think!

9
00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:12.490
Orange! Meera spotted a pattern

10
00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:18.920
Pattern = repeats in a way you can predict

11
00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:27.520
Repeats · and you can predict what's next

12
00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:38.610
Sequence: things in a row, one after another

13
00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:46.550
Nothing repeats? No pattern. Can't guess!

14
00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:51.120
Three kinds of patterns

15
00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:59.130
Colours: red, blue, red, blue → red!

16
00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:06.710
Shapes: circle, square, circle, square → circle

17
00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:16.020
Beats: clap, clap, stamp!

18
00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:23.910
Find the part that repeats

19
00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:29.220
Game: what comes next?

20
00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:37.790
Clap, clap, stamp, clap, clap, ___?

21
00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:42.520
Stamp! The beat is clap, clap, stamp

22
00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:57.300
Circle, circle, triangle… circle, circle, ___?

23
00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:05.160
Triangle! Two circles, then a triangle

24
00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:11.470
Sorting: putting alike things into groups

25
00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:22.170
Red, blue, circles, squares, all mixed up!

26
00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:30.800
Sort by colour: reds here, blues there

27
00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:42.300
Sort by shape: where do the circles go?

28
00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:55.080
All circles together, all squares together

29
00:03:55.080 --> 00:04:03.120
AI looks for patterns too!

30
00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:17.250
Many cat photos → a pattern: ears, whiskers…

31
00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:27.120
Not magic, not alive. It finds patterns.

32
00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:34.160
Nani's mango farm: thousands of mangoes!

33
00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:43.390
Which are ripe? What would you look for?

34
00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:53.580
Ripe: yellow · plump · no dark spots

35
00:04:53.580 --> 00:05:05.950
An AI machine checks each mango's pattern

36
00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:14.730
Thousands of mangoes, super fast!

37
00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:21.410
You find patterns with eyes and ears

38
00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:25.590
AI: numbers, pictures, and sounds

39
00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:38.730
Same idea. AI just checks thousands, fast!

40
00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:42.430
Your turn: practice check

41
00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:56.360
Red, blue, red, blue, ___? And why?

42
00:05:56.360 --> 00:06:08.840
Red! The colours take turns

43
00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:15.030
A pattern repeats: colour, shape, beat

44
00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:18.290
Sorting = grouping things that are alike

45
00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:22.190
AI finds patterns people notice too

46
00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:26.060
AI does it on thousands of things, fast

47
00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:32.310
Chapter 2 done!

48
00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:39.110
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
